# StudyMate AI — Environment Variables
#
# This template does NOT require any API keys in a .env file.
#
# AI provider API keys (Groq / OpenAI / Google Gemini / OpenRouter) are entered
# by the end user inside the app (Settings > AI Provider) and stored securely on
# the device. There is no hardcoded key and no build-time secret.
#
# This file is kept only as a placeholder for any environment-specific values
# you may add for your own build (e.g. analytics keys). Copy it to `.env` if you
# introduce such values:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Note: `.env*.local` files are gitignored. Never commit real secrets.
